{"ayah/10-100.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Yunus 10:100 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan tidak seorang pun akan beriman kecuali dengan izin Allah, dan Allah menimpakan azab kepada orang yang tidak berakal.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/10-100.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Yunus 10:100 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan tidak seorang pun akan beriman kecuali dengan izin Allah, dan Allah menimpakan azab kepada orang yang tidak berakal.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/10.html\">Surah Yunus</a> › Ayat 100</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Yunus 10:100</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا كَانَ لِنَفْسٍ أَن تُؤْمِنَ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ اللَّهِ وَيَجْعَلُ الرِّجْسَ عَلَى الَّذِينَ لَا يَعْقِلُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan tidak seorang pun akan beriman kecuali dengan izin Allah, dan Allah menimpakan azab kepada orang yang tidak berakal.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أي لا تكفي دعوتك في حصول الإيمان حتى يأذن الله لمن دعوته أن يؤمن<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/60</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإذنه ها هنا قضاؤه وقدره لا مجرد أمره وشرعه<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/60</cite></blockquote><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">سفيان الثوري (من رواية ابن المبارك)</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «بقضاء الله»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/60</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن جرير الطبري</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «يقول جل ذكره لنبيه وما لنفس خلقها من سبيل إلى أن تصدقك إلا أن يأذن لها في ذلك»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/60</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s10a100\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/10-99.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (10:99)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/10-106.html\">Ayat berikutnya (10:106)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/10-106.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Yunus 10:106 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan jangan engkau menyembah sesuatu yang tidak memberi manfaat dan tidak (pula) memberi bencana kepadamu selain Allah, sebab jika engkau lakukan (yang demi\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/10-106.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Yunus 10:106 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan jangan engkau menyembah sesuatu yang tidak memberi manfaat dan tidak (pula) memberi bencana kepadamu selain Allah, sebab jika engkau lakukan (yang demi\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/10.html\">Surah Yunus</a> › Ayat 106</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Yunus 10:106</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَا تَدْعُ مِن دُونِ اللَّهِ مَا لَا يَنفَعُكَ وَلَا يَضُرُّكَ فَإِن فَعَلْتَ فَإِنَّكَ إِذًا مِّنَ الظَّالِمِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan jangan engkau menyembah sesuatu yang tidak memberi manfaat dan tidak (pula) memberi bencana kepadamu selain Allah, sebab jika engkau lakukan (yang demikian), maka sesungguhnya engkau termasuk orang-orang zalim.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فنفى سبحانه عن هؤلاء المعبودين من دونه النفع والضر القاصر والمتعدي فلا يملكونه لأنفسهم ولا لعابديهم.<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/2</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s10a106\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/10-100.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (10:100)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/10-107.html\">Ayat berikutnya (10:107)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/10-107.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<hea